  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>On differentiating, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Differentiating the above equation again, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>''</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'''</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'''</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math>.</p>"
